    "Scan of the 1988 edition of the Lookout Pass, Montana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1980; field checked in 1982; last revised in 1988; printed in 1988.",
    "Release: Provisional. Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.1 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
